{"author":"rebar-bridge[bot]","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1787097955535978125,"compiled_state":{"alias":"complex-leftist-drafthorse","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":3,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"ec7178be97d0dc531f6ea02f3cdc8bd3db10e4f988a23003ef8dfc55b996dcda","event_uuid":"a4965e34-259d-4171-a02b-1b1bc133f021","position":{"commit_sha":"0028500a716bf46b6d3362a8936b3b0c7fbddf94","position":"1787095110680331001-a4965e34-259d-4171-a02b-1b1bc133f021"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"a4d9493cc28a422d45c9afb0e0a1b95996f47c8c6767ea652cbdfe71a0e67494","event_uuid":"6395e11b-aafc-42c8-a855-dab06da9daeb","position":{"commit_sha":"2f219b5be02bdc743b35f17e51e134696b6793be","position":"1787095159213523001-6395e11b-aafc-42c8-a855-dab06da9daeb"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"7a03157b2913c155513f02a505ca4956c5cc7815432056f523908687c9fcfef7","event_uuid":"1a1081c0-9a31-48a3-850f-1cbbc233a4fd","position":{"commit_sha":"a90fa0878781dd1e41664d7d630d62c0711e5bbc","position":"1787095247425201001-1a1081c0-9a31-48a3-850f-1cbbc233a4fd"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1787095110680331001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[],"description":"## Context / Problem\nSlice C1 (ticket 29a9-3cf7-3ded-42d8) recorded 18 below-seam ambient config/credential reads in the store / snapshot / io subsystem (_store, _snapshot, _io) as entries in `scripts/config_ownership_exceptions.LEGACY_EXCEPTIONS`. RP-04 is not complete while these ambient reads sit below the approved composition/credential/backend seams enforced by `scripts/check_config_ownership.py`. Parent: 075b-1479-dcb7-40ab.\n\nAffected files (relative to `src/rebar/`):\n  - `src/rebar/_io/import_ndjson.py`\n  - `src/rebar/_snapshot/git_fetch.py`\n  - `src/rebar/_snapshot/janitor.py`\n  - `src/rebar/_snapshot/repo_snapshot.py`\n  - `src/rebar/_store/ensures.py`\n  - `src/rebar/_store/env_identity.py`\n  - `src/rebar/_store/hlc.py`\n  - `src/rebar/_store/lock.py`\n  - `src/rebar/_store/project_ensures.py`\n  - `src/rebar/_store/push.py`\n\n## Outcome\nEvery below-seam read in the files above is either (a) CUT to compose through the approved seam that already assembles config — the operation snapshot (`rebar._operation_config.OperationSnapshot` / `compose_operation_snapshot`), a startup binding, or the provider-credential boundary — or (b) REGISTERED as an owned, non-legacy entry with an exact `path`+`symbol`+`rationale` for genuine test-only controls and protocol constants. Their `LEGACY_EXCEPTIONS` entries are removed. `python scripts/check_config_ownership.py` reports zero findings for these paths with those entries gone and no path-glob exception. The subsystem's behavioral suites stay green; redacted operation-snapshot fingerprints / provider-neutral outcomes are unchanged except recorded, justified deltas.\n\n## Plan\n1. For each below-seam read in the listed files, classify as cut-to-seam or register-owned; for cut-to-seam, thread the value from the composition seam rather than reading ambient `os.environ`/`os.getenv`/`load_config` below it.\n2. Remove the corresponding entries for these files from `LEGACY_EXCEPTIONS` in `scripts/config_ownership_exceptions.py`.\n3. Run `python scripts/check_config_ownership.py` and the subsystem behavioral suites (tests/interfaces/store, tests/integration store/snapshot suites); keep green.\n\n## Testing (RED -> GREEN)\n- Held-out test `tests/scripts/test_store_snapshot_io_seam_clean_heldout.py` asserts `check_config_ownership.check(check_config_ownership.REPO_ROOT)` returns no finding string containing any of the listed paths, AND that `config_ownership_exceptions.LEGACY_EXCEPTIONS` contains zero entries whose `path` is one of the listed files. RED now (entries present + reads below seam).\n- The subsystem behavioral suites (tests/interfaces/store, tests/integration store/snapshot suites) stay green after the cutover — they are the correctness oracle the AST gate supplements.\n- Redacted operation-snapshot fingerprints before/after are equal except recorded deltas.\n\n## Compatibility / rollback\nNo stored ticket/event/binding format changes. A legacy facade is removed only after its focused suite passes; until then rollback selects the facade.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] No direct ambient config/credential read, backend reload, or configurable default remains below the approved seam in the 10 listed files; each is cut-to-seam or registered as an owned (non-legacy) entry with rationale.\n- [ ] The `LEGACY_EXCEPTIONS` entries for these files are removed from `scripts/config_ownership_exceptions.py`, and `python scripts/check_config_ownership.py` passes with no path-glob exception (proven by the held-out `test_store_snapshot_io_seam_clean_heldout.py`).\n- [ ] The subsystem behavioral suites (tests/interfaces/store, tests/integration store/snapshot suites) pass after the cutover; redacted operation-snapshot fingerprints / provider-neutral outcomes are unchanged except recorded approved deltas.\n","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/_io/import_ndjson.py","reason":"Cut below-seam config/credential read to the approved seam."},{"path":"src/rebar/_snapshot/git_fetch.py","reason":"Cut below-seam config/credential read to the approved seam."},{"path":"src/rebar/_snapshot/janitor.py","reason":"Cut below-seam config/credential read to the approved seam."},{"path":"src/rebar/_snapshot/repo_snapshot.py","reason":"Cut below-seam config/credential read to the approved seam."},{"path":"src/rebar/_store/ensures.py","reason":"Cut below-seam config/credential read to the approved seam."},{"path":"src/rebar/_store/env_identity.py","reason":"Cut below-seam config/credential read to the approved seam."},{"path":"src/rebar/_store/hlc.py","reason":"Cut below-seam config/credential read to the approved seam."},{"path":"src/rebar/_store/lock.py","reason":"Cut below-seam config/credential read to the approved seam."},{"path":"src/rebar/_store/project_ensures.py","reason":"Cut below-seam config/credential read to the approved seam."},{"path":"src/rebar/_store/push.py","reason":"Cut below-seam config/credential read to the approved seam."},{"path":"scripts/config_ownership_exceptions.py","reason":"Remove C3b LEGACY_EXCEPTIONS entries as reads are cut to seam."},{"path":"tests/scripts/test_store_snapshot_io_seam_clean_heldout.py","reason":"Held-out proof: gate clean + zero legacy entries for these files."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","075b-1479-dcb7-40ab"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"075b-1479-dcb7-40ab","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"d074-ab22-e37a-4480","ticket_type":"task","title":"RP-04 S7.3.b — store-snapshot-io cutover: route below-seam config reads through seams","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["a4965e34-259d-4171-a02b-1b1bc133f021","6395e11b-aafc-42c8-a855-dab06da9daeb","1a1081c0-9a31-48a3-850f-1cbbc233a4fd"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787097955535978125,"uuid":"9f665985-0f09-48c2-9261-629e3ee8e8c5"}